 |\\\\n|-------|-------|\\\\n| Chunk 0 | 12 |\\\\n| Chunk 1 | 18 |\\\\n| Chunk 2 | 22 |\\\\n| Chunk 3 | 27 |\\\\n| Chunk 4 | 23 |\\\\n| Chunk 5 | 19 |\\\\n| **Total** | **121** |\\\\n\\\\n## Manual Verification Checklist\\\\n\\\\n1. Open a project shell with several artifacts and confirm artifact rows no\\\\n   longer mention attachment to one process.\\\\n2. Open a process that references an artifact first created elsewhere and\\\\n   confirm review is still available.\\\\n3. Open artifact review on an earlier version, then create a later version and\\\\n   confirm the earlier version remains selectable.\\\\n4. Open a zero-version artifact directly and confirm the workspace shows an\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/00-foundation/009-self-review-pass-1.json:1:{\\\"resultId\\\":\\\"64406627-3c14-4769-9e6e-1d2a3e2b78c2\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.4\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"story_self_review_pass\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019dcb8d-54d4-7882-8bd6-b820edf96e06\\\",\\\"continuation\\\":{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019dcb8d-54d4-7882-8bd6-b820edf96e06\\\",\\\"storyId\\\":\\\"00-foundation\\\"},\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"ready-for-verification\\\",\\\"story\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"00-foundation\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Story 0: Foundation\\\"},\\\"passNumber\\\":1,\\\"planSummary\\\":\\\"Completed the Story 0 follow-up by renaming the shared package-member browser vocabulary to `artifactVersionId`, wiring exact route-level review error taxonomy for explicit missing artifact versions and package members, and refreshing fixtures/tests so the foundation vocabulary now matches the story and DoD.\\\",\\\"changedFiles\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/review-workspace.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Replaced package-member `versionId` with `artifactVersionId` and removed the lega