faced\\\":[]},\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"specDeviations\\\":[\\\"Browser-facing package member contracts still expose legacy `versionId`; Story 0 added the durable/package-context `artifactVersionId` vocabulary and deferred the surface rename to avoid wider Story 3/4 regressions.\\\",\\\"Review target schemas still accept legacy `REVIEW_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` alongside `PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` as a compatibility bridge for existing package review flows.\\\"],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"Implement Story 1 against the new project-scoped artifact summary and package-context foundation.\\\"},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/00-foundation/001-implementor.json\\\"}],\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-04-26T20:48:50.222Z\\\",\\\"finishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-04-26T21:08:41.346Z\\\"}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/006-verify.stdout.log:149:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_72\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"nl -ba docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md | sed -n '220,320p'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"   220\\t| TC-3.2b | unrelated artifact remains unavailable when not in current refs or pinned context | Negative reviewability case |\\n   221\\t| TC-3.3a | selected earlier version is displayed | Explicit version path |\\n   222\\t| TC-3.3b | current-version review remains stable after newer versions exist | Guards drift to wrong current/pinned interpretation |\\n   223\\t| TC-3.4b | direct zero-version artifact review returns bounded empty state | Empty, not unavailable |\\n   224\\t| TC-3.4c | explicit version request against zero-version artifact returns