ignment\",\"title\":\"Story 4: Cross-Process Package Alignment\"},\"planSummary\":\"Aligned package publication with Story 4 rules by replacing same-process producer checks with same-project plus bounded package-context eligibility in both Convex and the in-memory store, then expanded coverage to prove mixed-producer publish/review/export and reopened pinned-version reuse.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated in-memory package publication validation to allow mixed-producer members only when they belong to the same project and are either current process refs or already pinned in the current package context.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\",\"reason\":\"Reworked durable package publication validation to use current process refs and current package-context pins instead of same-process producer ownership.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Refreshed package snapshot tests to cover mixed-producer success, cross-project rejection, and bounded package-context eligibility enforcement.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added durable package-context coverage for ordered upsert/read behavior, duplicate cleanup, clear behavior, and republishing an earlier pinned version after reopen.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated package review API coverage to exercise mixed-producer package members and pinned provenance through the review surface.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated export coverage so mixed-producer packages still export pinned contents successfully.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adjusted integration fixtures to seed current refs before package publication so the stricter Story 4 publish eligibility rule is exercised correctly.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.te