eopen auto-seeding, and republishing an earlier pinned version after reopen.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Adjusted package review fixtures and assertions so mixed-producer package members remain reviewable with pinned provenance.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Adjusted export fixtures so mixed-producer packages still export pinned contents successfully.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Seeded current refs in package-publication integration paths so the stricter Story 4 publication eligibility rule is exercised correctly.\\\"}],\\\"tests\\\":{\\\"added\\\":[\\\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\\\"],\\\"modified\\\":[\\\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\\\"],\\\"removed\\\":[],\\\"totalAfterStory\\\":543,\\\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\\\":5},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts --environment node\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"selfReview\\\":{\\\"findingsFixed\\\":[\\\"Removed the outdated same-process package publication restriction from both durable and in-memory publication paths.\\\",\\\"Added automatic reopen seeding so a current package context can inherit pinned members directly from a published snapshot when no explicit members are supplied.\\\",\\\"Added regression coverage for mixed-producer package publication, 