\"passNumber\\\":2,\\\"planSummary\\\":\\\"Aligned Story 4 package publication around same-project membership plus bounded current package-building context, added automatic package-context seeding from published snapshots on reopen, and refreshed coverage so mixed-producer publish/review/export plus reopened pinned-version reuse are exercised end to end.\\\",\\\"changedFiles\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated the in-memory package publication path to validate same-project members against current refs or already-pinned package-context versions, and taught package-context upsert to auto-seed from a published snapshot on reopen.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Reworked durable package snapshot publication to allow mixed-producer members only when they belong to the same project and are valid in the publishing process’s current package-building context.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Added durable reopen seeding so a current package context can automatically hydrate its pinned members from a published package snapshot.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Expanded package snapshot tests for mixed-producer success, cross-project rejection, and bounded-context rejection.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Added package-context durability coverage for ordered upsert/read behavior, duplicate cleanup, clear behavior, reopen auto-seeding, and republishing an earlier pinned version after reopen.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Adjusted package review fixtures and assertions so mixed-producer package members remain reviewable with pinned provenance.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Adjusted export fixtures s