ilds review target availability from current refs plus existing produced-artifact visibility, preserving prior behavior while enabling cross-process referenced artifacts.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Allows direct artifact review when the process currently references the artifact, while retaining produced-artifact review access.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds API coverage that project-shell artifact summaries exclude legacy process ownership fields.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds process-surface coverage for referenced-artifact materials labeling and review availability from current refs.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds review-route coverage for a later process reviewing an artifact produced by an earlier process.\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"tests\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"added\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"modified\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"removed\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"totalAfterStory\\\\\\\":556,\\\\\\\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\\\\\\\":3},\\\\\\\"gatesRun\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"selfReview\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"passesRun\\\\\\\":3,\\\\\\\"findingsFixed\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"Confirmed AC-1.1 through AC-1.3 are covered in behavior by stripping shell ownership fields, pre