{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_67","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/04-cross-process-package-alignment.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/export.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"convex/schema.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 4 against AC-4.1 through AC-4.4 by reading the story, full tech-design set, test plan, onboarding baseline, and the touched durable-state/store/review/export code paths. I focused on package publication eligibility, current package-context durability and reopen seeding, pinned-version package review/export behavior, and the supporting regression suite plus Story/Epic gates.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Current package-context reads and writes are exposed as unauthenticated public Convex functions\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/processPackageContexts.ts` registers `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` as a public `query` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` as public `mutation` handlers, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` exposes member enumeration as a public `query`; none of those handlers authenticate callers or validate a service key. `apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts` consumes them as server-side store primitives, while the comparable package snapshot publish/read path stays internal-only in `convex/packageSnapshots.ts`. As shipped, anyone who can reach the Convex deployment can read or overwrite another process's mutable package-building context, which breaks the story's process-scoped context guarantee and bypasses the Fastify control-plane boundary.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Current package-context reads and writes are exposed as unauthenticated public Convex functions\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/processPackageContexts.ts` registers `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` as a public `query` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` as public `mutation` handlers, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` exposes member enumeration as a public `query`; none of those handlers authenticate callers or validate a service key. `apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts` consumes them as server-side store primitives, while the comparable package snapshot publish/read path stays internal-only in `convex/packageSnapshots.ts`. As shipped, anyone who can reach the Convex deployment can read or overwrite another process's mutable package-building context, which breaks the story's process-scoped context guarantee and bypasses the Fastify control-plane boundary.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-4.1\",\"AC-4.3\",\"AC-4.4\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-4.2\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No production-path mocks, shims, or fake adapters were introduced in the Story 4 publish/review/export/package-context seams; the in-memory store and fake Convex contexts remain test-only evidence surfaces.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"`verify-all` passed, but the repo's `test:e2e` lane is still scaffold-only and prints a skip message, so integration coverage is the deepest executable end-to-end evidence for this story.\",\"Several Story 4 assertions are traceable by behavior rather than by test title because some package review/export test names still carry stale TC labels from adjacent chunks.\"]}"}}
